{"ticker":"MAHSEAMLES","symbol":"MAHSEAMLES","instrumentId":3023037,"name":"Maha. Seamless","industry":"NSE-Steel-Producers","about":"Maharashtra Seamless Ltd. is a key player in India’s steel pipe manufacturing industry, specializing in seamless and ERW (Electric Resistance Welded) steel pipes. The company serves a wide range of industries, including oil and gas, power, infrastructure, and automotive, delivering high-quality, corrosion-resistant steel products that meet global standards. With advanced manufacturing facilities, Maharashtra Seamless ensures efficient production and timely delivery of customized steel solutions for both domestic and international markets. The company’s focus on innovation, quality control, and sustainability has made it a trusted supplier for major industrial projects, contributing to infrastructure development and energy sectors worldwide.","website":"www.jindal.com","location":"Raigad, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:39:36.372Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":499.65,"changePct":-1.498275012321345,"week52High":737.65,"week52Low":490.9},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹6,695 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹4,731 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"40,199,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"197"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"18,493,015"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"2.00%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"0.97"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.04"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.84"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"21%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"9.78"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"5–17"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"10.2%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"69.61"},{"label":"Volume","value":"304,932"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"407,514"},{"label":"Master score","value":"44"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"36"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"31"},{"label